	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Pro benevolentia vestra, pater reverende, quam mihi nuper exhibuistis, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>gratias vobis ago maximas.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Die solis, cum iam advesperasceret <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>domum veni; meos omnes salvos et incolumes offendi.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">In via <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ad <placeName>Wesen</placeName> incidi in <persName ref="p3716">Rodolphum a Salicibus</persName> capitaneum, hominem <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>mirae modestiae, qui reliquum iter mihi comes fuit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Is <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>mihi in via, cum simul equis iremus, dixit se pro comperto <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>habere pacem esse factam.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Hoc mihi ita probabat: se, antequam <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>se viae daret, convenisse ducem <placeName>Ferrariensem</placeName> rogasseque, si <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>quid de pace actum esset, sibi pro veteri erga se benevolentia <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>impertiret.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ducem vero respondisse se iam meditari <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>abitum; nisi autem pax facta esset, se missionem vix a rege <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>impetraturum fuisse.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><persName>Dux Guisius</persName> ab eodem salutatus <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>in eadem verba respondit: <persName>Sabaudus</persName> ducat regis sororem; <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>rex restituat <placeName>Sabaudiam</placeName>, non <placeName ref="l736">Pedemontem</placeName>, pro <placeName ref="l736">Pedemonte</placeName> autem <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>solvat francos octoginta mille annuos; <persName>Sabaudus</persName> sit feudarius <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>regis <placeName ref="l832">Galliae</placeName>; restituat etiam rex <placeName>Sabaudo</placeName> comitatum <placeName>Burgobrässensem</placeName>; loca munita uterque rex sibi mutuo restitua<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>nt uno <placeName>Caleto</placeName> excepto; mortem <persName ref="p18554">reginae Angliae</persName> magnum momentum <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ad hanc pacem attulisse.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">An vero sponsalia futura sint <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>inter <persName>Philippi</persName> filium et regis <placeName ref="l832">Gallorum</placeName> filiam, de eo adhuc dubitatur; <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>connestablius in eo multum laborare fertur.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Der kunig <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>uß <placeName ref="l832">Franckrych</placeName> bütet des <persName>Philippi</persName> sun syn dochter an mit <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>dem geding, das er syn anspraach, so er vermeint ze han <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>an das herzogthumb <placeName ref="l306">Meyland</placeName> übergebe, des glychen auch <lb xml:id="p1z24"/><persName>Philippus</persName> thuͦn sölle, und sölle also das <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>herzogthuͦm des <persName>Philippi</persName> sun zuͦgestelt werden; wyter <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>sölle <persName>Philippus</persName> synem sun das künigrych <placeName ref="l994">Neapolis</placeName> übergeben.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/><persName>Philippus</persName> aber wendet für, wie er andere kinder überkommen <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>möchte, die er nit so gar könne berouben etc.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Haec <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>capitaneus, quae ego quidem, ut audivi, scribo, certi <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>nihil affirmo; tu haec boni nunc consulas.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Vale, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>reverende pater, et omnibus bonis viris ex me salutem dicito.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>D. <persName>Collino</persName> etiam socero significabis, iter satis feliciter <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>successisse, apud nos praeterea omnia esse salva.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale iterum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/><placeName ref="l98">Curiae</placeName> 12. decembris anno 1558.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z35"/><persName ref="p8009">Iohannes Fabricius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>tui observa<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>nt<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>issimus<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Clarissimo viro eruditione <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>et pietate excellenti d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> antistiti fidelissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>domino et patron<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>o suo multum observando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
